{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_bdrk_yablp7lkt27td2mqlwpxhrepfbullulstvaaj3rd3jgf53orxbja","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The Rust translation is complete. The build compiles cleanly with no errors and no warnings.\n\nSummary of what was implemented:\n\n1. **`src/utils/buffer.rs`** - `PgnBuffer` backed by a `String` with grow/reset/append/concat/detach operations\n2. **`src/utils/cursor.rs`** - Whitespace skip/revisit, comment skip with nested brace support, newline skip\n3. **`src/utils/export.rs`** - No-op platform-specific exports\n4. **`src/coordinate.rs`** - File-to-index helper handling both upper and lowercase\n5. **`src/piece.rs`** - `PgnPiece::from(char)` and `Display` for piece names\n6. **`src/score.rs`** - Score parser for `*`, `1/2-1/2`, `1-0`, `0-1`, `0-0`, `0-1/2`, `1/2-0`\n7. **`src/check.rs`** - Parses `+`, `++`, `#` for check/double-check/mate\n8. **`src/annotation.rs`** - Parses `!`, `?`, `!!`, `??`, `!?`, `?!` and NAG `$N` annotations\n9. **`src/comments.rs`** - PGN comment parsing with nested brace support and position tracking\n10. **`src/metadata.rs`** - Parses `[Key \"Value\"]` metadata blocks, preserving order\n11. **`src/moves.rs`** - The most complex piece: parses individual moves (castling, captures, en passant, promotion, alternative variations) and the recursive moves structure\n12. **`src/pgn.rs`** - Top-level parse driving metadata + moves + score\n\nAll `unimplemented!()` placeholders have been replaced with working logic that mirrors the C source semantically. The two `panic!()` calls (for unterminated comments) were converted to `assert!()` macros, matching the C `abort()` behavior on malformed input. No `unsafe`, no FFI, and no external crates were added."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1435,"cache_read_input_tokens":91208,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1435